SUMMARY:#BreatheWithMe: a wkly online restorative space designed for the B
 lack Community
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nContact and Register: SKY Schools https:/
 /www.eventbrite.com/e/breathewithme-a-restorative-space-designed-for-the-b
 lack-community-tickets-111197697306?aff=ebdssbonlinesearch\n\nSelf-Care an
 d Community of Practice Led by Black Facilitators\, for the Black Communit
 y.\n\nAbout this Event\n"Caring for myself is not self - indulgence\; it i
 s self-preservation\, and that is an act of political warfare." Audre Lord
 e\n\nThis is an invitation specifically for persons who identify as Black 
 or African American and are overwhelmed with the injustice of the world an
 d are ready to create space in their lives for self-care as we fight for j
 ustice for all! (We offer a parallel session for Allies to connect\, learn
  and find support in their work to dismantle racism at allies.eventbrite.c
 om)\n\nWe believe Black people deserve a space to relax\, reassess\, and r
 ealign ourselves.\n\nWe are a collective of Black stress-management & well
 ness instructors inspired by human values.\n\nWe are here to facilitate yo
 ur journey of trauma-relief and stress-management.\n\nImagine how much mor
 e energy you will have and how much more powerful you will be when you cut
  your stress levels in half!\n\nAnd it can be done in just a few minutes u
 sing nothing but your own breath...\n\nOver the last 10 years\, we've taug
 ht over 100\,000 people to do just that.\nThe key is that your breath is d
 irectly linked to your emotions.\n\nThis 1-Hour Restorative Session Includ
 es:\n-Open\, safe space for sharing and self-care for Black people\n-Facil
 itated discussion\n-Breath work and meditation\n\nLed by Black facilitator
 s\, certified in stress and trauma relief.\nUnleash the Hidden Healing Pow
 er of the Breath\n-SKY Schools\n\nRegister for zoom link: https://www.even
 tbrite.com/e/breathewithme-a-restorative-space-designed-for-the-black-comm
 unity-tickets-111197697306?aff=ebdssbonlinesearch
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/awakeningasheville/events/315716360/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260717T001828Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T001828Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
